  "details": "Heya, something I quite often have to adjust are my ear muff settings. This normally isn't a problem but it does get tiring having to write down what my previous settings were, or even worse when I play on another computer and all my settings are gone. \n\nIt would be nice having a few buttons, say three buttons, to switch between ear muff profiles depending on the environment. It would also be nice to share those profiles, but that is definitely more of a \"nice to have\", the buttons to switch between profiles would be a great addition already.",
